cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: asa-research-prototype
abstract: >-
  A uv-managed, packaged Python project developing a research prototype of a
  basic Artificial Social Agent, undertaken as part of PhD work on empathic
  human–robot interaction. This release is the project scaffold — packaging,
  tooling, test suite and documentation — ahead of the agent implementation.
